{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Do you thus requite YHWH.</b> An expression of astonishment — is it before Him that you act spitefully, when it is in His power to exact retribution from you, and He has benefited you with every good?" "<b>A foolish nation.</b> That forgot what was done for them." "<b>And not wise.</b> To understand what is born — that it is in His power to do good and to do harm." "<b>Is He not your Father, your Creator.</b> That acquired you — that nested you in the nest of rocks and in a strong land; that established you with every manner of תַּקָּנָה." "<b>He made you.</b> A nation among nations." "<b>ויכננך.</b> Afterward with every kind of basis and so — from you priests, from you prophets, and from you kings; it means that He included everything in it (Sifrei; Ḥullin 56)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:49:10.849751441Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}